<section>
	<h2 id="extras">Extras</h2>
	{# Demo Images #}
	{% part "content-includes/extras/demo-images" %}
	<h3 id="customizations">Customizations</h3>
	<p>If you need advanced customizations for this theme, we can do that. See our <a href="https://www.proteusthemes.com/services/theme-customization/">Theme Customization</a> page for details.</p>
	<h3 id="changelog">Changelog</h3>
	<p>
		<a href="{{ theme.changelogUrl }}" target="_blank">View the {{ theme.themename }} WP changelog</a>.
	</p>
	<h3 id="support">Support</h3>
	<p>
		If you need more help after all, you can <a href="https://www.proteusthemes.com/help/" target="_blank">write to us</a>.
	</p>
	<p>
		Before you write, send us a site report. It shows us your WordPress, PHP, theme and plugin versions, server settings and recent PHP errors, so we can troubleshoot without asking for a login. The <strong>ProteusThemes Support</strong> plugin that creates it is installed with the theme:
	</p>
	<ol>
		<li><a href="#updates">Register the theme</a>. Sending a report needs your registration.</li>
		<li>Open <strong>Tools &gt; ProteusThemes Support</strong>, review the report and click <strong>Send site report</strong>.</li>
		<li>Write to us and include this site's URL in your request.</li>
	</ol>
	<p>
		Nothing is sent until you click the button, and the report does not give us access to your site. If sending fails, click <strong>Copy site report</strong> and paste the report into your request. <a href="https://www.proteusthemes.com/help/send-site-report/" target="_blank">Read more about site reports</a>.
	</p>
</section>
